{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically queried the workspace, elicited medication names from the caregiver, and explicitly prevented self-administration of injections/IV antibiotics. All six responsibility-chain items are met without serious or minor error. Four high-order points were triggered and vigorously completed with case-specific, beyond-minimum actions: correcting misinformation (HO1), discovering hidden record facts (HO2), verifying contradictory/artifact-prone fragments (HO3), and adapting plans to real-world transport/caregiver constraints (HO4). Closure is safe, traceable, and executable with caregiver teach-back confirming the plan.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00283",
        "explanation": "Caregiver confirms the concrete plan including medication schedule, follow-up appointments, and red-flag recognition with a teach-back summary.",
        "quote": "我把备忘录写了几条：止痛药饭后吃三天，明早开始胃药；不自己买消炎针、破伤风针；颈托继续戴，睡觉也戴；脊柱外科一周内约号；耳鼻喉过几天复查，可能做听力检查；如果疼得厉害、发烧、耳朵流东西、黑便胃痛、头晕头痛厉害或者手脚没劲麻木加重，就去急诊。这样记有没有漏掉重要的？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The plan specifies medication timings, follow-up owners (ENT and spine surgery), red-flag criteria, and transportation/caregiver coordination confirmed by the family.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00168",
        "explanation": "The doctor provides a concrete, sequenced action plan: call the ward, book ENT, observe for red flags, and prepare for spine follow-up later.",
        "quote": "今晚： 电话联系原病区确认药品用法（这是今晚可以做的）。同时，约好明天上午的耳鼻喉门诊。密切观察老人情况，做好随时去急诊准备。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00246",
        "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes medication purpose, explains typical course, and sets clear conditions for follow-up versus emergency, avoiding antibiotic escalation.",
        "quote": "如果服药后耳朵疼痛、听不清的情况没有改善，甚至加重，或者在3天药吃完后症状还在，就按耳鼻喉医生的安排，在“过几天复查”或“做听力检查”时再评估。千万不要自行加用其他消炎药或抗生素"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00268",
        "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges and reinforces the caregiver's multi-item memory list including ENT follow-up, spine surgery, and red-flag criteria across turns.",
        "quote": "您的总结非常清晰、全面，已经把当前需要做的和需要注意的都覆盖到了。我没有发现重要的遗漏。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00190",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly lists the emergency signs including worsening pain, fever, severe headache, dizziness, ear discharge, and neurological changes.",
        "quote": "如果夜里只是疼痛持续但能忍受，就按计划等明天门诊；如果出现您提到的任何一项（疼痛明显加剧、发烧、剧烈头痛头晕、耳朵流东西、手脚没力或麻木加重），就不要等，立刻去急诊分诊。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00120",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides a practical, prioritized plan accounting for the caregiver's need to decide between ENT clinic versus emergency based on symptom severity and travel difficulty.",
        "quote": "老人戴着颈托行动很慢，我现在最担心的是：这个耳朵今天一定要去急诊吗？还是可以先挂今天/明天耳鼻喉门诊？"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "excellent",
